[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5078321426","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121760#issuecomment-5078321426","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121760","id":5078321426,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLrEJEg","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-25T11:30:03Z","updated_at":"2026-07-25T11:30:03Z","body":"Tested on macOS (both native macOS app with the same code added to `OS_MacOS` and iOS app), seems to be working fine and is about 5x faster, will check on iPad a bit later.\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n\r\n<summary>macOS code patch used</summary>\r\n\r\n```diff\r\ndiff --git a/platform/macos/os_macos.h b/platform/macos/os_macos.h\r\nindex 08c26d992e..28667057b9 100644\r\n--- a/platform/macos/os_macos.h\r\n+++ b/platform/macos/os_macos.h\r\n@@ -108,8 +108,9 @@ public:\r\n \tvirtual String get_distribution_name() const override;\r\n \tvirtual String get_version() const override;\r\n \tvirtual String get_version_alias() const override;\r\n \r\n+\tvirtual Error get_entropy(uint8_t *r_buffer, int p_bytes) override;\r\n \tvirtual void alert(const String &p_alert, const String &p_title = \"ALERT!\") override;\r\n \r\n \tvirtual Error open_dynamic_library(const String &p_path, void *&p_library_handle, GDExtensionData *p_data = nullptr) override;\r\n \r\ndiff --git a/platform/macos/os_macos.mm b/platform/macos/os_macos.mm\r\nindex ca0e69ff5d..5e011b82f8 100644\r\n--- a/platform/macos/os_macos.mm\r\n+++ b/platform/macos/os_macos.mm\r\n@@ -342,8 +342,13 @@\r\n \t// macOS versions older than 10.13 cannot run Godot.\r\n \treturn vformat(\"%s (%s)\", macos_string, get_version());\r\n }\r\n \r\n+Error OS_MacOS::get_entropy(uint8_t *r_buffer, int p_bytes) {\r\n+\tint status = SecRandomCopyBytes(kSecRandomDefault, p_bytes, r_buffer);\r\n+\treturn status == errSecSuccess ? OK : FAILED;\r\n+}\r\n+\r\n void OS_MacOS::alert(const String &p_alert, const String &p_title) {\r\n \tNSAlert *window = [[NSAlert alloc] init];\r\n \tNSString *ns_title = [NSString stringWithUTF8String:p_title.utf8().get_data()];\r\n \tNSString *ns_alert = [NSString stringWithUTF8String:p_alert.utf8().get_data()];\r\n```\r\n\r\n</details>","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5078321426/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5078376888","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121760#issuecomment-5078376888","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121760","id":5078376888,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLrHhuA","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_u